            </note>
            <note corresp="#d280-f3" n="65" xml:id="d280-f3-content">
                <p>For documentation concerning the sinking of the <hi rendition="#italic">Awa
                        Maru</hi> by a United States submarine on April 1, see <ref target="#pg460"
                        >pp. 460</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
